{"id":"93ae791420c1822a","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective.md","title":"Theorem — Epimorphisms of Sheaves are Locally Surjective","display":"Theorem — Epimorphisms of Sheaves are Locally Surjective","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective","aliases":["14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective"],"display":"Theorem — Epimorphisms of Sheaves are Locally Surjective","depends_on":["[[14-thm-sheaf-category-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Epimorphisms of Sheaves are Locally Surjective"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e8b8317e69a22cc8\" href=\"?note=e8b8317e69a22cc8\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-category-elementary-topos\">14-thm-sheaf-category-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e21364f5dcced9e7\" href=\"?note=e21364f5dcced9e7\" title=\"14-df-site-sheaf-category\">14-df-site-sheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4cd3b0d29b80beda\" href=\"?note=4cd3b0d29b80beda\" title=\"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity\">14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 是小站点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\">\\(F,G\\)</span> 是层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha:F\\to G\">\\(\\alpha:F\\to G\\)</span> 为自然变换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsEpi}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsEpi}(\\alpha)\\)</span> 在层范畴中解释；局部满性对覆盖筛量化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsEpi}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall t\\in G(C)\\ \\exists S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall f\\in S\\ \\exists s\\in F(\\mathrm{dom}(f))\\ (\\alpha_{\\mathrm{dom}(f)}(s)=G(f)(t)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsEpi}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall t\\in G(C)\\ \\exists S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall f\\in S\\ \\exists s\\in F(\\mathrm{dom}(f))\\ (\\alpha_{\\mathrm{dom}(f)}(s)=G(f)(t)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.7 Corollary 5 及其证明，印刷页 143–144；DjVu 第 77–78 图页。箭头的层像是逐点像的层化，即局部属于逐点像的截面。若局部满，则层像是整个目标，故箭头为满态射；反之拓扑斯的满态射正则，像等于目标，给出每个截面的局部提升。全局逐点满蕴含本条件，但逆向一般不成立：层范畴的余极限需要层化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-category-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"e8b8317e69a22cc8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-category-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-site-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"e21364f5dcced9e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity","status":"resolved","id":"4cd3b0d29b80beda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"F,G","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha:F\\to G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsEpi}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsEpi}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall t\\in G(C)\\ \\exists S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall f\\in S\\ \\exists s\\in F(\\mathrm{dom}(f))\\ (\\alpha_{\\mathrm{dom}(f)}(s)=G(f)(t)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1491,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective|Theorem — Epimorphisms of Sheaves are Locally Surjective]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-211","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective]]"},{"id":"b5c7b94c4e3c3168","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"24edea3e3589ffa1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III.7印刷144页在 Corollary 6 前明确将局部满性推广到任意预层映射。这里单列谓词，因为[[14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective]]只陈述层之间的判据；两者在层输入上完全相同。公式是逐箭头的存在，不预设在整个覆盖筛上选择一族相容原像。空筛可覆盖时，该对象处的局部条件真是空条件，不应额外要求逐点满射。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective]]"},{"id":"139c4bab72fb77d9","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"令 $*=\\varnothing$。终层的值与限制满足 $1(U)=\\{*\\}$、$\\rho^U_{1,V}=\\operatorname{id}_{\\{*\\}}$；$\\mathrm{Nat}_X$ 与 $\\operatorname{TNat}_X$ 采用 [[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]，满态射判别使用 [[14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective]] 的层范畴环境。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective|Theorem — Epimorphisms of Sheaves are Locally Surjective]]"},{"id":"ca489e8e614e025a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["e8b8317e69a22cc8","e21364f5dcced9e7","8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","4cd3b0d29b80beda"]}